{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2694810/extras/Pass.png?t=1746604036\" /><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From the studio behind <strong>Gremlins, Inc.</strong> and the game designer of <strong>Graveyard Keeper</strong> comes a story of friendship and betrayal set in the dying world of Rund. The magic powers of Kaira, the lead character, are exceptional \u2013 yet her mission will require more than that. It's hard to tell an ally from an enemy when the reality itself has two different sides...</p><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2694810/extras/track.png?t=1746604036\" /><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore the world</strong>, crossing between the two realms of Rund.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Prevail in the turn-based battles</strong>, combining weapons, magic and alchemy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Develop the party</strong> by leveling up and discovering new spells and recipes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Craft and concoct</strong>, creating weapons, equipment, alchemy and magic crystals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Engage in the adventures</strong>, exploring the secrets of the two realms of Rund.</p></li></ul><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2694810/extras/walking.png?t=1746604036\" /><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game has multiple layers of different mechanics that combine for replayability, and will challenge you with dozens of encounters in the story and the challenge modes!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2694810?t=1746604036","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2694810/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746604036","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstati